OL,3,GNEWSANew traffic restrictions for
OL,4,Aschool road trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoads around two schools are set to see
OL,7,Fa 20mph speed limit and a one-way
OL,8,Fsystem introduced as part of a safety
OL,9,Ftrial.
OL,11,FThe measures will affect roads near The
OL,12,FBourne Academy and Kingsleigh Primary
OL,13,FSchool in Bournemouth, from Thursday 3
OL,14,FSeptember.
OL,16,FOther changes will include restrictions
OL,17,Fon when disabled bays can be used.
OL,19,FBCP Council said the aim of the
OL,20,Fsix-month scheme is "to improve safety
OL,21,Ffor children travelling to school and
OL,22,Fto alleviate congestion issues".
